  name is phone 1, the second phone 2, and so on.

  To change a face, drop a square photo in as
  res/drawable-nodpi/avatar_t<table>_p<phone>.png (avatar_t2_p3.png is Ben, the
  third player at table two). Selfies taken on the night override these.
-->
